{"id": "7ecae1d4-28b6-465f-8d1f-e07c61ecdc74", "slug": "construct-spatial-engine", "title": "Construct - Spatial Engine", "description": "Construct Spatial Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Construct - Spatial Engine\"\ndescription: \"Construct Spatial Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#020202\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Construct - Spatial Engine\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 8; favorites: 6; remixes: 1.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nConstruct Spatial Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nManifest the void. Supply structural blueprints or mood boards. Our procedural engine iterates endless spatial topologies. CONSTRUCT BASE Compute 12.4k Ingest Reference Required Drop source files JPEG, PNG, DXF up to 50…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Manifest the void.; Ingest Reference; Engine Parameters.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #020202, accent #FFFFFF, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Construct - Spatial Engine</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#000000] text-gray-200 font-sans h-screen w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row overflow-hidden antialiased selection:bg-white selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Left/Background Area: Output Gallery Canvas (65% on Desktop) -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 relative h-[50vh] lg:h-full order-2 lg:order-1 overflow-hidden bg-[#030303]\">\n\n        <!-- Depth Overlays -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent z-10 w-1/2 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/20 to-transparent z-10 h-full pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Floating Hero Typography -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 lg:bottom-12 left-6 lg:left-12 z-20 max-w-lg\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white leading-none mb-4\">\n                Manifest<br>the void.\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                Supply structural blueprints or mood boards. Our procedural engine iterates endless spatial topologies.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Staggered Orthogonal Grid -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex gap-2 lg:gap-3 p-2 lg:p-3 opacity-50 scale-105\" style=\"transform-origin: center;\">\n\n            <!-- Column 1 -->\n            <div id=\"grid-col-1\" class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-3 w-1/4\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=600\" class=\"w-full aspect-[2/3] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=400\" class=\"w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=500\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Column 2 -->\n            <div id=\"grid-col-2\" class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-3 w-1/4 pt-12 lg:pt-24\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753190-17f0baa2a6c3?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=500\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503387762-592deb58ef4e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=600\" class=\"w-full aspect-[2/3] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=400\" class=\"w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Column 3 -->\n            <div id=\"grid-col-3\" class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-3 w-1/4\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=400\" class=\"w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=600\" class=\"w-full aspect-[2/3] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753190-17f0baa2a6c3?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=500\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Column 4 -->\n            <div id=\"grid-col-4\" class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-3 w-1/4 pt-8 lg:pt-16\" style=\"will-change: transform;\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503387762-592deb58ef4e?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=600\" class=\"w-full aspect-[2/3] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=400\" class=\"w-full aspect-square object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n                <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400&h=500\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-md border border-white/5 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700\" alt=\"Topology\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Right Area: Control Sidebar (35% on Desktop) -->\n    <aside class=\"w-full lg:w-[420px] xl:w-[460px] h-[50vh] lg:h-full flex flex-col order-1 lg:order-2 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-l border-white/[0.06] bg-[#020202] z-30 flex-shrink-0 shadow-2xl relative\">\n\n        <!-- Top Nav / Meta -->\n        <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 border-b border-white/[0.06] flex-shrink-0\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white text-black flex items-center justify-center rounded\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-wide text-white\">CONSTRUCT BASE</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light\">\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-500\">Compute</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-white font-normal\">12.4k</span>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Scrollable Parameters Panel -->\n        <section class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 flex flex-col gap-8 custom-scrollbar\">\n\n            <!-- Ingest Zone -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white\">Ingest Reference</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-light px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.05]\">Required</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div id=\"blueprint-drop\" class=\"group relative w-full h-40 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-white/20 bg-white/[0.01] hover:bg-white/[0.03] hover:border-white/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-pointer overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff05_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:1rem_1rem] opacity-50\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center z-10 mb-3 shadow-md group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-add-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white z-10 font-normal\">Drop source files</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-1 z-10\">JPEG, PNG, DXF up to 50MB</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <hr class=\"border-white/[0.04]\">\n\n            <!-- Parameters -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white\">Engine Parameters</h2>\n\n                <!-- Custom Dropdown: Pipeline Model -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                    <label class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-light\">Pipeline Architecture</label>\n                    <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2.5 bg-[#080808] border border-white/[0.08] rounded-lg text-xs hover:border-white/[0.15] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-white/20\">\n                        <span class=\"text-gray-200 font-light flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:buildings-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Conceptual Topology v4\n                        </span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-gray-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Custom Slider: Abstraction Weight -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-3\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <label class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-light\">Abstraction Weight</label>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-white font-light\">0.85</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-full\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[85%] bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-500 to-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[85%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 bg-white rounded-full shadow border border-black cursor-grab\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Aspect Ratio Pills -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                    <label class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-light\">Output Format</label>\n                    <div class=\"flex bg-[#080808] rounded-lg border border-white/[0.08] p-1 gap-1\">\n                        <button class=\"flex-1 text-center py-1.5 text-xs text-gray-400 hover:text-white font-light rounded transition-colors\">1:1</button>\n                        <button class=\"flex-1 text-center py-1.5 text-xs text-white bg-white/10 shadow-sm font-normal rounded transition-colors border border-white/5\">16:9</button>\n                        <button class=\"flex-1 text-center py-1.5 text-xs text-gray-400 hover:text-white font-light rounded transition-colors\">9:16</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Custom Toggles -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-4 pt-2\">\n                    <!-- Active Toggle -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <label class=\"text-xs text-gray-200 font-light\">Ultra-Res Synthesis</label>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\">Export at 8K resolution</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-9 h-5 rounded-full bg-white flex items-center p-0.5 cursor-pointer flex-shrink-0\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-black translate-x-4 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Inactive Toggle -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                            <label class=\"text-xs text-gray-200 font-light\">Enforce Determinism</label>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\">Lock seed for reproducibility</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-9 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/5 flex items-center p-0.5 cursor-pointer flex-shrink-0\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-gray-400 shadow-sm\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Spacer for bottom action area -->\n            <div class=\"h-6\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Sticky Action Footer -->\n        <div class=\"p-6 border-t border-white/[0.06] bg-[#020202] flex-shrink-0\">\n            <button class=\"w-full py-3 px-4 bg-white text-black text-xs font-normal rounded-lg shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                Synthesize Topologies\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <style>\n        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }\n        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }\n        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; }\n        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // Subtle Infinite Orthogonal Scroll Animation\n        window.addEventListener('load', () => {\n            const columns = [\n                { id: 'grid-col-1', speed: 0.15 },\n                { id: 'grid-col-2', speed: -0.2 },\n                { id: 'grid-col-3', speed: 0.18 },\n                { id: 'grid-col-4', speed: -0.15 }\n            ];\n\n            columns.forEach(colData => {\n                const el = document.getElementById(colData.id);\n                if (!el) return;\n\n                // Clone inner HTML for seamless looping\n                el.innerHTML += el.innerHTML;\n\n                let pos = 0;\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    // Approximate height of original content block\n                    const halfHeight = el.scrollHeight / 2;\n\n                    if (colData.speed > 0) {\n                        pos = -halfHeight;\n                    }\n\n                    function animate() {\n                        pos += colData.speed;\n\n                        if (colData.speed < 0) {\n                            if (pos <= -halfHeight) pos = 0;\n                        } else {\n                            if (pos >= 0) pos = -halfHeight;\n                        }\n\n                        el.style.transform = `translate3d(0, ${pos}px, 0)`;\n                        requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    }\n\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                }, 200);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "construct-spatial-engine.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/construct-spatial-engine.jpg", "source_name": "construct-spatial-engine-DESIGN.md", "views": 96, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T06:18:40.568949+00:00"}